“compline priority analysis using GIS and text classification techniques”

This API helps government officers to:

--read complaint text (road / garbage)
--use location (GIS / OSM) to understand nearby context
--detect recurring complaints
--calculate a priority score (0–100) and priority level
--show an explainable officer output (clear reasons)
-- Important: This system supports officers, it does not replace their decision. 

Update Component

2) Main workflow (simple)

Citizen submits complaint (text + location link / lat lon)
System expands text (optional)
AI/NLP reads text → urgency / impact / frequency signals
GIS/OSM fetch checks nearby map features (POI, road class, bridges/crossings, junctions)
Recurring detection checks same area complaints
Priority score + level + track (Planning / Operational)
Officer gets clear output (summary + reasons + GIS popup details) 
Update Component

